# Pictures never go in git. They live in the folder you set as PRIZM_MEDIA
# (default: media/ beside this tool). That is the single
# home for every picture this lane makes — full-res output, sources, all of it.
#
# The web-copy exception was tried on 2026-08-26 and reversed the same day
# (Damon: "remove the image copies on github"). Two homes for one image is
# worse than one home anyone can reach — the Drive copy is the full-res
# original, not a downscale, and nobody has to guess which is current.
#
# Pictures only. The stage text in out/, the manifests and the specs stay in
# git: they are the refine material, and a prompt change is only judgeable
# against what the last one produced.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.heic
*.mp4
*.mov
runs/*/assets/*.gemini-uri.json
runs/*/finals/.compose-tmp/

__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
.DS_Store
.swipe-cache/

# The board itself is GENERATED and does not belong in git (SI-4 (board files),
# 2026-09-22). build_ui.py writes both on every run, and refresh.sh runs it
# EVERY 30 SECONDS while the board is up — so each one that got committed added
# ~25 MB to the pack permanently. Both are over workspace rule 3's 10 MB limit
# (12.9 MB and 12.8 MB at the time of this change) and always were.
#
# Nothing is lost by ignoring them: build_ui.py rebuilds both from runs/ and the
# manifests, which DO stay in git for the reason the note above gives. The files
# keep their paths on disk and serve.py keeps serving them — this only stops the
# pack growing.
#
# NOTE ON FIRST PULL: git removes these two from your working tree when this
# change arrives, because they stop being tracked. refresh.sh puts them back
# within 30s; otherwise run `python3 build_ui.py` once.
#
# status.json is written by the same three lines and is deliberately NOT listed
# here: at 3.4 KB it crosses no wall, and whether it stays tracked is Damon's
# call, not this change's assumption.
image-board.html
board.json

# Working runs, generated boards and retired tool snapshots stay out of git.
runs/
board.html
board-*.html
*-board.html
tools/superseded/
*.webp
*.gif

# Your pictures (PRIZM_MEDIA unset) — never in git.
media/
